{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-12T17:31:52.531Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-PROGRAMS-LIVE-01","attempt":1,"title":"A weighted supermajority ballot that misses its bar and then meets it exactly, and a pro-rata pool, run by the hosted Roost on a real Phala TDX VM and settled on testnet","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. The VM attests the new pinned image; a weighted ballot at a 70% bar decides nothing and leaves the escrow untouched; the same signed votes at a 60% bar (exactly the winner's weighted share) decide, and the contract accepts the settlement with every voter charged one equal share; an oversubscribed pro-rata pool charges each member exactly the scaled amount and pays the recipient exactly the total; teardown leaves nothing.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM. This is the system working on real hardware, not independent parties.","The attestation proves which image and compose the VM runs; it does not audit the code inside the image.","Two settled rounds and three members: not a long-lived or large group. Deposits and payouts are public on NEAR, so pro-rata and weights hide nothing extra.","Weights are supplied by the coordinator and are public in the request. Testnet only."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"243efd12993f0722da2582cb3184b30850219e3900bfdf09bca6b45fc7807330","chain_hash":"105fae2990dad8aef0f728cd865ad46399b56d5091d85276c1fdfc796287ca1b"}
